    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer about climbing an endless mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything is physically simulated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your Path and your BUFFs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Demo coming soon!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer about climbing an endless mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything is physically simulated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/5908571cb7b41b4478cfcd8682820bc5.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your Path and your BUFFs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/71742fbbc02ff63f339fc118b63a7946.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.poster.avif?t=1755723096\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.webm?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/4316b88e43b1bfe4e93f2d69f6764836.mp4?t=1755723096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Demo coming soon!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
